Thank you for creating an XIVAuth account! Before you can sign in for the first time, you need to verify your e-mail address. You may do so by visiting the below link in a web browser of your choice:

<%= user_confirmation_url(confirmation_token: @token) %>

Please be aware that this code will expire after 14 days.

After successfully verifying your email address, your XIVAuth account will be activated and you will be able to create and verify characters, sign in to XIVAuth-protected services, and manage developer applications.

If you have any questions or issues, feel free to reach out via any of the following methods:

* Send an email to xivauth@wolf.dev
* Join the XIVAuth Discord (<%= discord_url %>), and ping @KazWolfe

Thanks,
XIVAuth User Management Service
